{
  "version": 4,
  "name": "UI that reads the frame under it. The world is black on the left and white on the right with a red quarter at the top left. One panel draws the frame it covers from a small level of its copy, so the edge between black and white is a ramp inside it and still a step outside; another draws the copy as it is across the red quarter's lower edge, which says the copy is the right way up. A panel handed no copy draws magenta.",
